## Skill Review — critique before freezing

A new skill is about to be saved to the library. Act as a rigorous reviewer: a
skill is only worth keeping if it is **specific**, **correct**, **genuinely
reusable**, and **not a duplicate** of an existing one. Be skeptical — a vague or
one-off "skill" is worse than no skill (it bloats the library).

